            >
              Графік ціни показує entries/exits вибраної стратегії, cancelled orders, equity, drawdown і position exposure.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article
            class="feature glass"
            style="--i: 3;"
          >
            <div
              class="featureIcon"
            >
              <svg
                class="lucide lucide-chart-column"
                fill="none"
                height="22"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                width="22"
                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              >
                <path
                  d="M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16"
                />
                <path
                  d="M18 17V9"
                />
                <path
                  d="M13 17V5"
                />
                <path
                  d="M8 17v-3"
                />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3
              class="featureTitle"
            >
              Глибокі метрики
            </h3>
            <p
              class="featureText"
            >
              PnL, fees, max drawdown, worst unrealized loss, time in position, time in loss, recovery та max exposure.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article
            class="feature glass"
            style="--i: 4;"
          >
            <div
              class="featureIcon"
            >
              <svg
                class="lucide lucide-workflow"
                fill="none"
                height="22"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-linecap="round"
